### 1. Lấy CSRF Token
# @name getCsrf
GET http://localhost:3000/api/auth/csrf
Content-Type: application/json

### 2. Thử nghiệm Đăng nhập Credentials
POST http://localhost:3000/api/auth/callback/credentials
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

csrfToken={{getCsrf.response.body.csrfToken}}
&email=dtphat.dev@gmail.com
&password=123456
&json=true

### 3. Đăng ký Partner mới
POST http://localhost:3000/api/partners
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "partnerType": "BUSINESS",
  "businessName": "ABC Hotel Group",
  "representativeName": "Nguyen Van A",
  "phone": "0901234567",
  "country": "Vietnam",
  "city": "Can Tho",
  "address": "123 Nguyen Trai"
}